      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "I am old. I am fat. I am bald. My toenails have turned strange. I am repulsive. How repulsive? I don't know for I suffer from a condition called Body Dysmorphic Disorder. I am fat, but am I as fat as I think? My therapist says no, but people lie."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 6,
        "line": 905,
        "text": "I like that name. Charlie. I've always really liked that name. Charlie."
